This project's plugin structure and packaging conventions are adapted from
OpenAI's "codex-plugin-cc" (https://github.com/openai/codex-plugin-cc),
Copyright 2026 OpenAI, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The implementation has been substantially rewritten by Statistica: it targets
the Statistica AI agent via the Statistica API, ships an original single-tool
MCP server, and supports both Claude Code and Codex hosts.

Portions of the authentication flow are adapted from the Statistica Code CLI,
